        <h2>Species information</h2>
        <div>
          <h4>&nbsp;</h4>
          <h4>Identification</h4>
          <p>
            An evergreen coniferous tree growing up to 35 metres. The bark is a scaly orange-brown, which develops
            plates and fissures with age. Twigs are green-brown and hairless.
          </p>
          <hr />
          <h4>Distribution</h4>
          <p>Common in Scotland</p>
        </div>
